@host = http://localhost:5320

### ─── LET Requests ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Get all LET requests
GET {{host}}/api/LetRequests?page=1&pageSize=20

### Get LET request by number
GET {{host}}/api/LetRequests/1001

### Create a new LET request
POST {{host}}/api/LetRequests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeUserId": "EMP001",
  "requestDate": "2025-01-15T00:00:00",
  "departmentCode": "IT",
  "supervisorUserId": "SUP001",
  "requestType": "T",
  "remark": "Annual training request"
}

### Add sub-entry to LET request
POST {{host}}/api/LetRequests/1001/sub
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestNumber": 1001,
  "courseNumber": 2001,
  "courseDescription": "Advanced .NET",
  "startDate": "2025-03-01T00:00:00",
  "endDate": "2025-03-05T00:00:00",
  "trainingProvider": "Microsoft",
  "estimatedCost": 2500.00
}

### ─── Feedback ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Get all feedback
GET {{host}}/api/Feedback?page=1&pageSize=20

### Get feedback by number
GET {{host}}/api/Feedback/3001

### Submit feedback
POST {{host}}/api/Feedback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courseNumber": 2001,
  "participantUserId": "EMP001",
  "feedbackDate": "2025-03-06T00:00:00",
  "overallRating": 4,
  "remark": "Excellent training",
  "details": [
    {
      "questionCode": "Q1",
      "questionText": "Course content relevance",
      "rating": 5
    },
    {
      "questionCode": "Q2",
      "questionText": "Instructor effectiveness",
      "rating": 4
    }
  ]
}

### Cancel feedback
POST {{host}}/api/Feedback/3001/cancel

### ─── Reviews ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Get pending reviews
GET {{host}}/api/Reviews/pending?page=1&pageSize=20

### Get review by number
GET {{host}}/api/Reviews/4001

### Submit a review
POST {{host}}/api/Reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestNumber": 1001,
  "reviewerUserId": "REV001",
  "reviewDate": "2025-03-10T00:00:00",
  "reviewType": "A",
  "remark": "Annual review"
}

### Approve a review
POST {{host}}/api/Reviews/4001/approve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reviewNumber": 4001,
  "approvedByUserId": "MGR001",
  "remark": "Approved"
}

### ─── Minimal API v2 ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Get LET request (v2)
GET {{host}}/api/v2/let-requests/1001

### Get feedback (v2)
GET {{host}}/api/v2/feedback/3001

### Get review (v2)
GET {{host}}/api/v2/reviews/4001

### ─── Health Checks ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Overall health
GET {{host}}/health

### Liveness
GET {{host}}/health/live

### Readiness
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### ─── GraphQL ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Get LET request via GraphQL
POST {{host}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "{ letRequest(requestNumber: 1001) { requestNumber employeeUserId requestDate subEntries { serialNumber courseDescription } } }"
}

### Get pending reviews via GraphQL
POST {{host}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "{ pendingReviews(page: 1, pageSize: 10) { reviewNumber reviewerUserId reviewDate reviewStatus } }"
}
